      "id": "claim_aac10aacc2ea4debb4befa1be6600a5b",
      "statement": "Traditionally, JPA “Entity” classes are specified in a persistence.xml file. With Spring Boot, this file is not necessary and “Entity Scanning” is used instead. By default the auto-configuration packages are scanned.",
